      "link": "https://github.com/williamowen65/atlas-the-public-think-tank/blob/PTT-98-125-rest-api/docs/api/AUTHENTICATION.md",
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A hostile origin normally cannot read Atlas\u2019s JSON token. SameSite adds defense; it is not the whole defense.\nGET reads need no CSRF header. Global policy covers future writes; explicit controller attributes show CodeQL the policy.\nLogin is protected too: forced login can attach the victim\u2019s later actions to an attacker-controlled account.",
      "originalText": "A hostile origin normally cannot read Atlas\u2019s JSON token. SameSite adds defense; it is not the whole defense.\nGET reads need no CSRF header. Global policy covers future writes; explicit controller attributes show CodeQL the policy.\nLogin is protected too: forced login can attach the victim\u2019s later actions to an attacker-controlled account.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
