      "text": "\u201cnode\u201d abbreviates /api/nodes/{node}. Root/reply next pages send afterAt + afterId together in the same scope.\nRemoved comments remain placeholders. Limits slow mutations; they do not cap comment nesting or total lifetime votes.",
